    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get what u mean about it being debunked, but when people talk about \"race-realism\" they usually bring up specific studies or data, like the Bell Curve or certain psychometric papers. can u explain what those specific arguments actually are? like, what are they pointing to as \"evidence\"?",
